  data: {
    LLM: "In a 6-player game, information is highly fragmented. Trust your teammates to help clear suits you are weak in.\n\nThe Duplicate Rule: Use the 'First One Wins' rule to your advantage. If you know the other set's Ace is still in play, play yours early to gain the lead on tie-breaks.\n\nKitty Management: Discard tiles into the kitty that clarify your 'No Trump' leads. If you can void a suit by discarding into the kitty, you can trump in earlier.",
    Player: "In a 6-player game, information is highly fragmented. Trust your teammates to help clear suits you are weak in.\n\nThe Duplicate Rule: Use the 'First One Wins' rule to your advantage. If you know the other set's Ace is still in play, play yours early to gain the lead on tie-breaks.\n\nKitty Management: Discard tiles into the kitty that clarify your 'No Trump' leads. If you can void a suit by discarding into the kitty, you can trump in earlier.",
